{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=law",{"Hey, partner","Anything on your end?","All quiet?","Radio's dead on my end, how about yours?","East side's clear, last I checked","Any word from the office?","You need relief? I'm good for another hour","Watch the crossing by the school, a few got through there","Copy, 10-4","You too, deputy","Keep an eye on the courthouse, we've got a few people inside","Anybody coming up behind you?","Sergeant's looking for you, FYI","Funny, I thought I was the only one still on shift","Got a flat on the cruiser, so I'm walking, don't ask","You alright? You look rough","Saw you at the station Friday, you were already running","I haven't seen you since Thursday, thought you were gone","Did you hear what happened to Mike's unit? I'd rather not say it here","Everything okay on Main? I heard shots earlier","Folks, everything alright over here?","Folks, anyone injured? We can get a medic","You folks need an escort? We're heading that way anyway","Easy, we're county, just checking on everyone","That your place? Looks quiet, that's good","Anyone giving you trouble on this block? Tell me","Deputy, how's your end? Anything move?","You tried the radio? I did, it's just static now","Folks, need an escort?","Hey, it's a small county, but I haven't seen you before","Somebody was moving on the ridge earlier, just saying","You eat today? Even law needs to eat","I've been up since yesterday, so, if I make no sense","Hey, you hear that? Never mind, nothing, I'm jumpy","Station's got a pot of coffee, if you want some, that's not a joke","The sergeant's looking for volunteers, run if you're smart","Heard anything from the Muldraugh station? We lost contact","You got a spare radio battery? Mine's flat","Hey, how's the deputy with the bad knee? Still on his feet?","Got word the courthouse is holding, that's something","Any of ours at the bridge? I haven't seen them","Doing your rounds? I'll take the north side","We found a stray dog, I'm calling it Deputy, don't tell the chief","Any luck with the roadblock? Anybody come through?","Keep a tally of who passes, we'll need the list","You see the SWAT guys? They went east about an hour ago","Haven't had a hot meal since Friday, you?","Anybody tell the families we're still here?","You're limping, get that looked at, that's an order","Hey, you got a smoke? I swore off, but, you know","Damn it, who stole my coffee? I'm kidding, I know it's gone","Shit, I thought you were a looter, sorry","Hell of a day, Deputy, hell of a day"}},
