{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=swat",{"I'm still watching. How are you?","Moving, don't cross our line","Team's through, you're free to go","Eyes up, we've got civilians ahead","Coming through, left side","Sector's clean, nothing on my side","Hold position, and hold your fire","Good to see you, we thought you were pinned down","Any trouble? Nothing here","Keep up, we're stretched thin","Your leader's looking for you, so move","Move, the others are waiting on us","Sector's clean, rear guard, close it up","Eyes high, watch the rooftops","Clear left, clear right, good","Team's tight, nothing to report","Hold here, I'll scout ahead","You see anything? Movement? Think hard","Radio silence, hand signals only","Anybody got eyes on the leader? I lost him","Quiet, we're nearly there","Team two's late, anyone hear from them?","Hold, hold, okay, go","Stay in file, don't bunch up","Keep the muzzle down, there are civilians","Short break, ten minutes, hydrate","Anyone got eyes on the lead? I can't find him","Stack up, we're going in slow","Rear's covered, move","Hold the corner, I'll check the next","Lead says move, so move","Sectors, then sectors again","Keep your spacing, don't bunch","Say again?","Radio's dead, so hand signals only","Slow is smooth, smooth is fast","Anybody have eyes on the second floor?","Breacher's up, hold fire, we've got civilians","Clear, clear, one more","Team's tired, give us ten","You see that? Movement, left, never mind","Our van's gone, so we're on foot, that's the plan"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=swat|world=window",{"Watch the windows, don't trust any of them"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=military",{"Sergeant, how's the line?","Anything to report?","Quiet on the east, nothing moving","Copy, moving on","Your relief's late, so I'll hang around","Watch your sector, I've got mine","Roger that, keep it tight","Orders from the colonel, no one gets through without screening","We're short on ammo, so don't waste any","How's morale on your end? Mine's on a break","Anything from base? We've heard nothing in two days","Eyes front, civilians ahead, keep it polite","Haven't seen you in days, thought you'd gone AWOL","You see the Humvee? It's stuck in the mud, don't ask","Corporal, status? Anything on your side?","Convoy's late, no word on why","Hey, how are your feet? Mine are killing me","Anybody got a spare magazine? I'm light","Rations again, cardboard and cheese, I'm not complaining","You see the lieutenant? He said he'd be back an hour ago","Fall in, we're heading out, it's a long walk","Haven't seen a civilian in a day, that's a first","Keep the noise down, the quiet's all we've got","Colonel's orders, no one goes north, no exceptions","I miss the mess hall, can you believe that? The mess hall","Sergeant, you want the north post or the east?","Anything new from the colonel? No? Typical","Morale's low, so, keep cracking jokes","Hey, did your unit get rations? Ours didn't","Dry socks, that's all I want, dry socks","Perimeter's holding, but it's thin","Shit, you scared me, I almost shot you, sorry, sorry","Hell of a deployment, no one said we'd be hunting the neighbors"}},
