{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=military|day=0,4",{"Orders are to hold the line, so we're holding","Stay with the group, don't wander off alone","They said the evacuation was coming, but there's no one here","We've got civilians everywhere, it's like a zoo","No one told us about this at training"}},
