{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=elite",{"Sector's clear","On the move","Nothing to report. I'll keep moving","Good, go ahead, we'll cover","Radio check, how copy?","Standing by","Wrong way, other direction","You didn't see us, we didn't see you","Nothing to report. Moving on","Rear's clear, go","Cover me, I'm crossing","Status check, how copy?","Quiet, we're not here","Ghost two, in position","Clear on your six, move","Short halt, check weapons","Switch with me, I'll take point","Radio's quiet, keep it that way","Ghost one, clear","Switch, I've got your six","Don't break formation","Civilians ahead, hold fire","Good hunting","Anything on your side?","Easy, we're being watched","Hold, let them pass","Tight and quiet, that's the way","You're late, we're moving","Nothing on the north approach","Say again your last?","Cover my left, I'm crossing","Hand signals only from here","Walk soft in the grass, they hear us"}},
