{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian",{"Hey, you two alright?","Hey there","Any luck?","Find anything worth carrying?","Heading to the school? Heard there's buses","Going to the church? It's open, I think","How's your mama and them?","You still got your dog?","Haven't seen you since the church picnic","Seen any deputies today?","Kmart's empty, don't bother","Radio's all static today, you hear anything?","Hardware store's picked over, but the back room might be untouched","Hey, you're alive. I wasn't sure we'd see anyone","Where'd you come from? Is it bad that way?","I've got half a jug of water, if you're running low","You folks eaten? We found some canned corn","Hey, you made it, I was worried","Anybody following you? No? Okay, go ahead","Hey, hey, hold up- never mind, you look busy","You hear that earlier? Never mind, nothing, forget it","Excuse us, coming through, sorry","After you, we're in no hurry","Don't mind us, we're just passing","Mind if we walk with you a while? Strength in numbers and all that","Nice to see somebody not running","You got a smoke? Even half one?","People. Thought we were the last ones out here","I'm headed home, you headed home? Everybody's headed home","Hey, anybody at your place got a spare can opener?","You look familiar, did you work at the bank?","Hey, you're Carl's sister, aren't you? How's he holding up?","Don't go past the old mill, we heard a bunch of 'em in there","Go slow, there's glass all down that block","Hey, wait, you're going the wrong way, I'd know","You're not bit, are you? Just checking, no offense","Where are you guys staying? Nobody's said anything about a shelter","Any news from Louisville? Any at all?","We saw a helicopter, you see it? Which way did it go?","How'd you make out at the Kmart? Don't tell me, I already know","You still at the old place on Elm? I haven't seen smoke from there","Nobody home in the Pruitt house, so don't bother knocking","Gas station's got nothing but beef jerky left, and I wouldn't touch that","Heard there's a ham radio guy out in West Point, you know him?","Is the bridge still out? Somebody said the bridge was out","They say the Army's got a camp at Fort Knox, is that true?","I'd wave but I've got a limp, so, hello from here","If you're selling anything, I'm buying, I'm that desperate","Don't suppose you've got a spare life? Mine's running low","We're boiling the creek water out back, if you ever need some","You look like you could use a sit-down, take a load off","You find a doctor, send him my way, I've got a rash that won't quit","You two sticking together? Good, that's smart","I'm out of cigarettes, and I'm starting to see why people quit","Your boy okay? I haven't seen him since Friday","Is that the church up there? It looks like the church","Seen a white pickup with a camper top? My uncle's got one","You folks from town? Anybody left in {town}?","I was a bank teller, I know nothing useful","You hear the hum earlier? Or is that just me?","Is anybody cooking? I smelled bacon, it was a lie","Anybody got news from the north? Anything, even a rumor","How'd you sleep? I know, I know, stupid question","Whoever's got the baby, keep her quiet, please, sound carries","You look like somebody I should know, sorry, I'm bad with faces","You two look like you know what you're doing, I'm jealous","Seen the church? Is it open? Please say yes","I'm headed to the hardware store, anything I should know?","Were you the one yelling earlier? No? Then who was that","Did you find the pharmacy? Did it have anything left? Even aspirin?","How much farther to the river? My feet are done","Think it'll rain? My knee says yes, my knee's usually wrong","You know a place with a working well? Our bucket's almost empty","Is the old man on the corner still alive? He used to wave","Hey, you okay? Need a hand with anything?","Anybody home at your place? We're short a roof","You carrying anything heavy? I could take a turn","I think I know you from the diner, you had the pancakes, right?","You two look put together, how do you do it?","Is it safe to cross there? I don't want to be the guinea pig","Hey, how are your folks? Everybody holding up?","Don't mind my dog, he's old and blind, but he's sweet","If you see a man in a red cap, tell him Sue's looking","We saw a deer earlier, it was the best part of my week","Rosewood's overrun, I wouldn't go that way","West Point had a roadblock last I heard, not sure who's behind it","Riverside's been quiet, if you're thinking of going there","There's a church group up at March Ridge, they're taking people in","You come through Brandenburg? Is the bridge still standing?","Remember the county fair? I keep thinking about the funnel cakes","You ever eat at the diner on Main? Best pie in the county","My brother-in-law's got a boat on the Ohio, if we can get to it","I'd trade you my good boots for a pair of dry socks, I'm serious","Heard anything about the Army base? Anything at all?","I'd offer you a drink, but all I've got is creek water","You looking for a place to hole up? There's a trailer by the tracks, empty","The VFW hall's still standing, it's got a door that locks","Don't trust the water in the pond behind the school, it smells wrong","Do you think the Wildcats will play this year? I'm being serious","You know any good songs? We could use one","Pass the word, the church kitchen's got soup on Tuesdays","I haven't had a decent cup of coffee since the ninth, I'd marry anyone with a percolator","You've got a good walk, like you know where you're going","Don't tell me where you're headed, I don't want to know, just in case","Are you from Louisville? I'm so sorry, I heard about Louisville","My cousin's a mechanic in Elizabethtown, if you see him, tell him Carol's alive","You ever think this is a bad dream? Because I do, constantly"}},
