{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh",{"Are you okay? You look like you saw something","Is it true what they're saying about the Army? Did you hear?","I can't believe this is happening, can you?","My sister's in West Point, have you heard anything from there?","You doing any better at this than I am?","Where are you going? Can I come? I'm sorry, I don't want to be alone...","Did you sleep? I didn't, I kept hearing things","I thought it was just me out here","It was a regular Friday, wasn't it? I keep thinking about that","Please tell me you've got a plan, because I'm out of ideas","They say the deputies are at the courthouse, do you know?","I just want to go home, but home's not there anymore","Do you know anyone with a car? Any car that works?","Is it getting worse? It feels like it's getting worse","I keep thinking I should be at work, is that crazy?","Do you think they'll find a cure? Don't tell me if you don't","I haven't seen my family in six days, I'm trying not to think about it","Excuse me, have you seen a woman in a green coat? She's my mother","Were you at the church on Sunday? I thought I saw you","Have you got a radio? I'll trade you my watch for it","I don't know where I'm going, I'm just following the sun","Are you scared, or is it just me? Say you're scared too","I keep thinking somebody will tell us what to do","I'm so sorry, I'm not good at this, are you friendly?","Please, are you going to the school? I'm too scared to go alone","Do you know what happened to the radio stations? They're all just noise","Is it true they're burning houses in West Point? I heard it from a lady","I haven't talked to a stranger in days, so, hello, sorry","Please be real... oh good, you're real","I keep looking for my phone to check the time, and then I remember","Is that a gun? Is it loaded? Sorry, silly question","Do you have any idea what we're supposed to do? I feel like somebody should know","I haven't cried yet, and I'm scared of when I do"}},
